The killer bees have gotten me a few times too. Always before I can
find or reliably cast fireball too, which usually makes short work of
bees as well as the rest of Team Ant.

If you really want to have fun with fireball though (perhaps to
relieve some aggression towards NetHack denizens) go into wiz-mode,
give yourself a ton of magic mapping scrolls, potions of monster
detection, potions of gain level, and a spellbook of fireball, and
then go through level after level looking for a throne room, bigroom,
treasure zoo, or leprechaun room. Once you find one, stand right in
the doorway or right outside the room, target three or four squares
inside the room, cast fireball, and repeat. You will find the
resulting carnage most amusing, especially if you have conflict on and
walk into the room first. :)



